(# ACES Technician App Ч Build & Distribution Guide) Tj
0 -13 Td
() Tj
0 -13 Td
(## Overview) Tj
0 -13 Td
() Tj
0 -13 Td
(A React Native \(Expo\) mobile app for field technicians to:) Tj
0 -13 Td
(- Receive mission assignments and push notifications) Tj
0 -13 Td
(- View fueling task details \(fuel readings, site info, driver notes\)) Tj
0 -13 Td
(- Submit daily follow-up reports \(reviewed / issue / pending\)) Tj
0 -13 Td
(- Connect to the ACES Managed Services API) Tj
0 -13 Td
() Tj
0 -13 Td
(---) Tj
0 -13 Td
() Tj
0 -13 Td
(## Quick Start \(Testing via Expo Go\)) Tj
0 -13 Td
() Tj
0 -13 Td
(Technicians can test the app immediately on their phones without installing an APK:) Tj
0 -13 Td
() Tj
0 -13 Td
(1. Install **Expo Go** from the App Store \(iOS\) or Google Play \(Android\)) Tj
0 -13 Td
(2. Scan the QR code shown in the Replit preview sidebar) Tj
0 -13 Td
(3. Log in with your technician credentials \(email + password\)) Tj
0 -13 Td
() Tj
0 -13 Td
(> **Note:** Push notifications are not active in Expo Go. All other features \(login, missions, follow-ups\) work ) Tj
0 -13 Td
(  fully.) Tj
0 -13 Td
() Tj
0 -13 Td
(---) Tj
0 -13 Td
() Tj
0 -13 Td
(## Firebase Setup \(Required for Push Notifications\)) Tj
0 -13 Td
() Tj
0 -13 Td
(Push notifications use the **Expo Push API** backed by Firebase Cloud Messaging \(FCM\). You need a Firebase proje) Tj
0 -13 Td
(  ct for Android push delivery.) Tj
0 -13 Td
() Tj
0 -13 Td
(### Step 1 Ч Create a Firebase project) Tj
0 -13 Td
() Tj
0 -13 Td
(1. Go to [console.firebase.google.com]\(https://console.firebase.google.com\)) Tj
0 -13 Td
(2. Click **Add project** ? name it \(e.g., `ACES Technician`\)) Tj
0 -13 Td
(3. Disable Google Analytics \(optional\) ? **Create project**) Tj
0 -13 Td
() Tj
0 -13 Td
(### Step 2 Ч Add an Android app to Firebase) Tj
0 -13 Td
() Tj
0 -13 Td
(1. In your project overview, click the **Android** icon) Tj
0 -13 Td
(2. Set **Android package name**: `com.acessa.technician`) Tj
0 -13 Td
(3. Click **Register app**) Tj
0 -13 Td
(4. Download the `google-services.json` file) Tj
0 -13 Td
() Tj
0 -13 Td
(### Step 3 Ч Replace the placeholder google-services.json) Tj
0 -13 Td
() Tj
0 -13 Td
(Copy the downloaded file into the project:) Tj
0 -13 Td
() Tj
0 -13 Td
