() Tj
0 -13 Td
(### Prerequisites) Tj
0 -13 Td
() Tj
0 -13 Td
(1. Create a free account at [expo.dev]\(https://expo.dev\)) Tj
0 -13 Td
(2. Install EAS CLI:) Tj
0 -13 Td
(   ```bash) Tj
0 -13 Td
(   npm install -g eas-cli) Tj
0 -13 Td
(   eas login) Tj
0 -13 Td
(   ```) Tj
0 -13 Td
(3. Complete the Firebase Setup above and ensure `google-services.json` is replaced.) Tj
0 -13 Td
() Tj
0 -13 Td
(### Steps) Tj
0 -13 Td
() Tj
0 -13 Td
