(# ACES Managed Services Ч Platform Overview) Tj
0 -13 Td
() Tj
0 -13 Td
(## Overview) Tj
0 -13 Td
() Tj
0 -13 Td
(pnpm workspace monorepo using TypeScript. Consists of three apps:) Tj
0 -13 Td
(1. **Admin Web Portal** Ч operations management \(missions, drivers, sites, technicians\)) Tj
0 -13 Td
(2. **Driver Mobile Web App** Ч driver daily tasks \(part of web-portal artifact\)) Tj
0 -13 Td
(3. **Technician Native App** Ч Expo React Native app for field technicians \(iOS & Android\)) Tj
0 -13 Td
() Tj
0 -13 Td
(## Stack) Tj
0 -13 Td
() Tj
0 -13 Td
(- **Monorepo tool**: pnpm workspaces) Tj
0 -13 Td
(- **Node.js version**: 24) Tj
0 -13 Td
(- **Package manager**: pnpm) Tj
0 -13 Td
(- **TypeScript version**: 5.9) Tj
0 -13 Td
(- **API framework**: Express 5) Tj
0 -13 Td
(- **Database**: PostgreSQL + Drizzle ORM) Tj
0 -13 Td
(- **Validation**: Zod \(`zod/v4`\), `drizzle-zod`) Tj
0 -13 Td
(- **API codegen**: Orval \(from OpenAPI spec\)) Tj
0 -13 Td
(- **Build**: esbuild \(CJS bundle\)) Tj
0 -13 Td
(- **Frontend**: React + Vite + Tailwind CSS + shadcn/ui) Tj
0 -13 Td
(- **Routing**: Wouter \(not react-router-dom\)) Tj
0 -13 Td
(- **Data fetching**: TanStack React Query \(generated hooks\)) Tj
0 -13 Td
() Tj
0 -13 Td
(## Structure) Tj
0 -13 Td
() Tj
0 -13 Td
